Changes in v3:
  - only the host bank's interrupt is requested; the handler holds the
    lock across the status read and the FIFO drain
  - pending status is cleared before draining; the drain is bounded by
    the FIFO depth
  - last_tx_done() reports done only once the remote has drained the
    FIFO (Sashiko)
  - only the host bank's clock and reset; reset released through a devm
    action, clock through devm_clk_get_enabled()
